{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは。\n新内眞衣です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近兼任先のOLの会社の社内では\n社長が変わったり\n人が移動してきたり、\n移動してしまったり\n慌ただしいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"社内が変わるとイレギュラーな\nことが増えるみたいで\nバタバタしてます。\n私も、少しでも手助けできるよう\n頑張らなくては！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑さも加わってきたので、\nダウンしないように気をつけて\nいかなきゃな〜〜(u_u)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さてさて！\n個別握手会のこと！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週末は個別握手会でした！\nたくさんの方とお話し出来て\n楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カーキのワンピース"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"珍しくカジュアルだから\n皆んなに驚かれた！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部 3部"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"青のワンピースに白のパンプス。\n2部はこれにプラスカーディガン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってな感じでした(*^_^*)\n皆さんはどれが好きだったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話の内容としては\n12枚目シングルのことが\n圧倒的に多くて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのほかにも\nまいちゅんカフェ\nOL生活\n乃木坂カフェ\nNOGIBINGO\n乃木坂工事中\nモバメ\nなどなど\nいろんなお話しができて\n楽しかったですV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東の個別握手会はこれからしばらく\nないから少しさみしいですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会が7月にあるので、\nまたそこでお会いしましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして！\n明日は遂に11枚目シングル最後の個握！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なに着ようかな〜〜？？\nなに話そうかな〜〜？？\n楽しみだな〜〜。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋で待ってますね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミューコミ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の月曜日はミューコミ＋プラスに\nゲストとして真夏さんとかなさんと\n出させて頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲奈さん、吉田アナウンサー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お二人とも本当に仲が良くて\nとっても楽しかったです♩♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送を長くやられてるので\n臨機応変に対応するのが\nとても上手で何度も助けて\n頂きました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リスナーの皆さんも\n胸キュンフレーズに\n投稿してくれた方も\nありがとうございますV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にたくさんのメッセージが\n来ていて嬉しかったです♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またゲストとして出られたら\nいいな〜〜(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいちゅんカフェ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2週連続ひなちまが\nゲストに来てくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メールも急遽募集したのに\nたくさんのメッセージがきて\n嬉しかったですV(^_^)V"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまは本当に色っぽくて\n収録中も声と笑顔に癒されました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いてくれてた方はどうだったかな？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がオススメする\nひなちまのパーツも注目してみてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また水曜日にbayFMで会いましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/13/9818526/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎のぎ天"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台湾クイズ 前編 後編\n公開中です〜V(^_^)V\nぜひ見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎6/14 20:30〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文化放送 乃木坂46の「の」\nみなみ 優里さん 私の3人です♩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◎6/14 24:00〜"},{"type":"break"},{"ty